sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Web as Web App
    participant API
    participant DB as Database
    User->>Web: Open dashboard
    Web->>+API: GET /session
    API->>+DB: SELECT session
    DB-->>-API: session row
    API-->>-Web: 200 OK
    Note over Web,API: Session is cached for 5 minutes
    loop Every 30s
        Web->>API: Poll notifications
    end
    opt Has unread
        API-)Web: Push badge count
    end
    par Load widgets
        Web->>API: GET /widgets
    and Load profile
        Web->>API: GET /profile
    end
    Web--xUser: Render page
